mutation write the API token into the Pages artifact
detects NoSecretPublished
only Success
-   /\ artifact' = "counts"
+   /\ artifact' = "secret"

mutation discard prior daily history during archiving
detects ArchivedHistoryRetained
only Success
-  /\ archive' = "retained"
+  /\ archive' = "lost"

mutation continue deployment after a failed Cloudflare query
detects FailureKeepsPrevious
only Failed
- FetchFailed ==
-   /\ phase = "history"
-   /\ HasCredentials
-   /\ ~FetchOk
-   /\ phase' = "failed"
+ FetchFailed ==
+   /\ phase = "history"
+   /\ HasCredentials
+   /\ ~FetchOk
+   /\ phase' = "ready"

mutation accept failed query as validated counts
detects PublishedCountsAreValidated
only Failed
-   /\ ~FetchOk
-   /\ phase' = "failed"
+   /\ ~FetchOk
+   /\ phase' = "validated"
